{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__1___3_.gif?t=1746639207\" />&quot;Incredible things coming out of Latin America right now&quot; - kenkaioh (NRZGAMES)<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__2___1_.gif?t=1746639207\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__18_.gif?t=1746639207\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>CURSOR BLAST</strong></i></u> is a SPACE SHOOTER in the style of old school SHMUPs with spaceships, heavily inspired by those from the Nintendo and Super Nintendo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IT'S A TRIBUTE TO THE GAMES OF THE 90'S, TO THE <span class=\"bb_strike\">BOOTLEG</span> GAMES OF THE 90'S, WHERE ONE GAME WAS RELEASED AND A THOUSANDS OF SIMILAR GAMES CAME WITH IT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>to infinity and beyond</strong>, want to play <i><u>5 minutes</u></i>? <strong><i>Make yourself comfortable</i></strong>. Want to play <i><u>60 hours in a row</u></i>? <strong><i>Feel free</i></strong> too, <span class=\"bb_strike\">if you can stay alive</span> with your ship by then. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOU ARE A SPACE SHOOTER THAT, IN ORDER TO SURVIVE HUGE HOARDS OF ENEMIES, <u>NEEDS TO SHOOT AND AIM WITH THE MOUSE INSTEAD OF STRAIGHT SHOTS</u>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOUR <strong>COMFORT</strong> OF JUST PASSING IN FRONT OF THEM TO HIT THEM IS OVER, YOU'RE DRIVING, SO YOU AIM TO HIT THE ENEMIES. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your stylish movement skills to stay mobile and avoid the relentless attacks of the most varied enemies.\u00a0<u><i><strong>Aim with your mouse</strong></i></u> and take advantage of the <u><i>non-linear aiming</i></u>!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ALL GAME IMPROVEMENTS ARE CHOSEN BY CARDS AFTER THE END OF A WORD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel-1.png__10_.png?t=1746639207\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> INFINITE STAGES PASSING THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE <u><i>GALACTIC STATE</i></u>, <span class=\"bb_strike\"><u><i><strong>HELL IS HEAVEN</strong></i></u></span><u><i><strong> COMPARED TO QUANTITY!</strong></i></u> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LIVE AS LONG AS YOU CAN! CARDS HAVE RARITY! POSSIBLE NEW POST-LAUNCH MODES PLANNED ACCORDING TO NEXT UPDATES; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EAT A <strong>BIG STEAK AND DRINK\u00a0 SUGAR CANE JUICE</strong> WHILE PLAYING THIS <u><i><strong>WONDER!</strong></i></u> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLAY THE GAME WITH ALL YOU CAN, WHO KNOWS YOU MAY GET THE <strong>PLATINUM </strong>ONE DAY, WHO KNOWS!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691030?t=1746639207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/3424c14aace3daf87d9a1cdc967791969cee2382/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746639207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/9be32f919e1095b2621b64e92aef88036f849847/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746639207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/9be32f919e1095b2621b64e92aef88036f849847/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746639207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__1___3_.gif?t=1746639207\" />&quot;Incredible things coming out of Latin America right now&quot; - kenkaioh (NRZGAMES)<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__2___1_.gif?t=1746639207\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__18_.gif?t=1746639207\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>CURSOR BLAST</strong></i></u> is a SPACE SHOOTER in the style of old school SHMUPs with spaceships, heavily inspired by those from the Nintendo and Super Nintendo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IT'S A TRIBUTE TO THE GAMES OF THE 90'S, TO THE <span class=\"bb_strike\">BOOTLEG</span> GAMES OF THE 90'S, WHERE ONE GAME WAS RELEASED AND A THOUSANDS OF SIMILAR GAMES CAME WITH IT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>to infinity and beyond</strong>, want to play <i><u>5 minutes</u></i>? <strong><i>Make yourself comfortable</i></strong>. Want to play <i><u>60 hours in a row</u></i>? <strong><i>Feel free</i></strong> too, <span class=\"bb_strike\">if you can stay alive</span> with your ship by then. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOU ARE A SPACE SHOOTER THAT, IN ORDER TO SURVIVE HUGE HOARDS OF ENEMIES, <u>NEEDS TO SHOOT AND AIM WITH THE MOUSE INSTEAD OF STRAIGHT SHOTS</u>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOUR <strong>COMFORT</strong> OF JUST PASSING IN FRONT OF THEM TO HIT THEM IS OVER, YOU'RE DRIVING, SO YOU AIM TO HIT THE ENEMIES. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your stylish movement skills to stay mobile and avoid the relentless attacks of the most varied enemies.\u00a0<u><i><strong>Aim with your mouse</strong></i></u> and take advantage of the <u><i>non-linear aiming</i></u>!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ALL GAME IMPROVEMENTS ARE CHOSEN BY CARDS AFTER THE END OF A WORD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel-1.png__10_.png?t=1746639207\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> INFINITE STAGES PASSING THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE <u><i>GALACTIC STATE</i></u>, <span class=\"bb_strike\"><u><i><strong>HELL IS HEAVEN</strong></i></u></span><u><i><strong> COMPARED TO QUANTITY!</strong></i></u> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LIVE AS LONG AS YOU CAN! CARDS HAVE RARITY! POSSIBLE NEW POST-LAUNCH MODES PLANNED ACCORDING TO NEXT UPDATES; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EAT A <strong>BIG STEAK AND DRINK\u00a0 SUGAR CANE JUICE</strong> WHILE PLAYING THIS <u><i><strong>WONDER!</strong></i></u> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLAY THE GAME WITH ALL YOU CAN, WHO KNOWS YOU MAY GET THE <strong>PLATINUM </strong>ONE DAY, WHO KNOWS!</p></li></ul>","developers":["NRZGAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/53afc6a778fbe5606c50688d6321f48bafb0dd42/header.jpg?t=1746639207","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136480,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136480/movie480.mp4?t=1746636681","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136480/movie_max.mp4?t=1746636681"},"name":"Cursor Blast Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136480/caa1ec598531a19f22971eae1cb4a55babc35d57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746636681","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136480/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746636681","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136480/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746636681"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257132054,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132054/movie480.mp4?t=1746585658","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132054/movie_ma